{"parse": {"title": "TTSC-19", "pageid": 134774, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTSC-18\" title=\"TTSC-18\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTSC-19</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTSC-20\" title=\"TTSC-20\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTSC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">19</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9A.90.E5.96.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"隐喻\">隐喻</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 隐喻</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Metaphor</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>献<span class=\"color-value\"></span>祭<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>颜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>色<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>象<span class=\"color-value\"></span>征<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>颜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>色<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>永<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>褪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>变<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>颜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>色<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3510119</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_07\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即便被道破身份，男人也没有展现出任何惊慌，只是沉静地看向洛伦兹蝴蝶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>这算什么，凶手的茶话会吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>蝴蝶女士，您不是早就知道这一切了么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>是啊，但我仍然享受这种道破关键的时刻。当然，如果你的脸色能变化得剧烈一些会更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身份成谜的女士好整以暇地说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>那么，请开始吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>让我们从这幅壁画开始说起。看看它上面的图案。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_30.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_30\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_30\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_5_bg_30.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_30.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"234\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_5_bg_30.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_30.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_5_bg_30.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_30.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2764\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>在阿兹特克神话传说中，蝴蝶与蜂鸟，是死亡与重生的象征。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>死去的战士在太阳神的领域生活四年后，他们会转世成蝴蝶和鸟类，重返人间汲取花蜜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>穆列尔认为，“午夜厨房”的艺术家们都是勇敢的战士，他们必将成为越过死亡而回归的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-645601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-645601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-645601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>确实如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>这十只环绕在画面上的蜂鸟与蝴蝶，代表着十个复生的灵魂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313921.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-313921.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313921.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313921.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-313921.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313921.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-313921.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313921.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>但这幅壁画上——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313921.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-313921.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313921.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313921.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-313921.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313921.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-313921.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313921.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>七起凶杀案的死者，包括穆列尔自己和最后才完成的除灵师拉莫纳在内，却只有九个人的形象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-313910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-313910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-313910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>还有一个人，他究竟藏在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>这是穆列尔在壁画上进行的精心设计——一个明显的隐喻，一个无伤大雅的玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_30.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_30\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_30\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_5_bg_30.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_30.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"234\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_5_bg_30.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_30.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_5_bg_30.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_30.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2764\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>他叫你野木蓝。所有人都这么叫你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>这是一种产自墨西哥南部的草本植物，通过复杂的提炼过程，可以制作出光彩夺目的靛蓝色颜料。它昂贵，鲜亮，不易褪色，是一种珍稀的材料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-313901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>早在哥伦布时代以前，原住民就使用它来为领袖的斗篷染色。靛蓝与胭脂红一样，代表着权力，是原住民文化的一部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313918.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-313918.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313918.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313918.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-313918.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313918.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-313918.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313918.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>看这些河流，背景上的树木，它们都呈现出如此明亮、仿佛能令人灼伤的颜色……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313917.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-313917.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313917.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313917.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-313917.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313917.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-313917.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313917.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>我猜测，壁画上的这些部分，都是使用野木蓝颜料所绘制的。你就藏在这个画作最显眼的地方，无处不在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313919.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-313919.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313919.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313919.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-313919.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313919.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-313919.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313919.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>穆列尔并不是那个唯一越过“暴雨”的人，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-313920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-313920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-313920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>在当年，还有一个人，一个“午夜厨房”艺术家集会的成员，也同样想要学习欧洲的绘画技术，于是陪伴着他一同前往巴黎。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_07\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>那个人正是你，野木蓝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>这能代表什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>我确实越过了“暴雨”，我从未否认过这点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>噢，这能代表的事情就非常多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>那些受害者，你们所挑选的意识容器，都是一些与昔日友人有一定相似之处的神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>他们被各种各样的方式引诱，最终都接触俱乐部，带回了让自己殒命的那一幅画作——一封精心炮制的死亡来信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>诚然，穆列尔是一个神秘学研究上的天才。他在罗西教授的启发下，仅通过查阅神话典籍，就能研发出他想象中的“起死回生术”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>但他错误的方式，使他每绘制一幅画作，就会失去一部分的记忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>到最后，他已经不能称得上是一个完整的存在了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>这样的他，又怎么具备实施如此精密计划的能力？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>试想一下，在墨西哥城数十万的人口中，寻觅到八个与记忆最接近的目标，又引导他们接触一幅自己本不感兴趣的画作……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>这需要多么缜密的安排与细致的人性观察，才能将这些人一步一步地引导到对应的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>你才是那个在背后操纵一切的人，野木蓝。你从来不是什么黑帮的受害者，缺乏自保手段的颜料商人只是你的伪装。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>最精妙绝伦的部分在于，这一系列的凶杀案，本身就是引导除灵师拉莫纳走入布局的一部分！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>你观察她，利用她的性格，知晓她是多么嫉恶如仇，又热爱着这片土地，热爱着这座城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>你指引她走到这幅壁画前，完成你们最后的愿想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>因此，我只有一个疑惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>请问吧，蝴蝶女士。无论是什么，我都言无不尽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>告诉我，这样一个心思细致、掌控一切的凶手，为什么在最后关头，没有尝试阻止我，而让一切付诸东流？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闻言，男子反而露出了然的神色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>这竟然是您最感兴趣的部分吗，女士？我想我明白了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>您的推论非常准确，蝴蝶女士。在您这样的行家面前，我不过是班门弄斧罢了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_32.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_32\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_32\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Cg-3_5_bg_32.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_32.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"255\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Cg-3_5_bg_32.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_32.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Cg-3_5_bg_32.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_32.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2540\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>四年间，我们总共穿越了六次“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>每一次重返墨西哥城，寻找合适的人选，都是一个充满困难的过程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>穆列尔的研究逐渐深入，为了完成这一切，我们脱离了重塑之手，毕竟他们不需要一颗不受控制的棋子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>数次，研究被“暴雨”打断；而仪式本身的不断失败，更是让情况变得越来越糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>我寻找、观察着每一个人选，寻找他们与友人“灵魂”的契合之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>但我越是观察，就越清楚地意识到：她们并非同一个人。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_at_32.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_at_32\"><img alt=\"3_5_at_32\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-3_5_at_32.png/600px-Cg-3_5_at_32.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-3_5_at_32.png/900px-Cg-3_5_at_32.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-3_5_at_32.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_at_32.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>拉莫纳小姐，她很好。只是，她不是特蕾莎，也永远不可能成为特蕾莎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>那个我们所有人都敬仰的，如同太阳一般温暖与热烈的特蕾莎，她永远不会回到我们身边了，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_at_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_at_13\"><img alt=\"3_5_at_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_5_at_13.png/600px-Cg-3_5_at_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_5_at_13.png/900px-Cg-3_5_at_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_5_at_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_at_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>拉莫纳小姐有着自己的故事，自己的向往与未来。她守护着这里，而我……无法去摧毁这一切。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_07\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>仅此而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>……真的吗？仅此而已？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的面上写满怀疑，而男子只是浅笑一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>如果这样未能令您满意，那么请让我换个说法吧，蝴蝶女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>经历过这么多次的“暴雨”，我也曾数次前往未来，见证了我们追求与愿想的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>最终我只是发现，我们的生活周而复始，艺术实际上并不能做到任何真正的改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>那些反叛与变化的思想，最终都被资本吸收，成了广告与商品上的精美包装，成为艺术史上的一个段落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>而唯一仍与我一同的伙伴，他已经失去了所有，变得面目全非。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>我好像一个人走了很远的路程……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>我只是感到累了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>非常可惜，她并没有寻觅到任何超出想象的阴谋与危机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>啧。你的回答当真是让我有些失望了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>我一直认为像<b><span style=\"font-size:111%\">我们</span></b>这样的人是不会感到累的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>“我们”……？哈。真是荣幸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>蝴蝶女士，谈论了如此多关于我的话题，您是否有兴趣，来聊聊您自己？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>——我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她眼中的玩味褪去了。但对方无视了危险的信号，只是继续淡然说着。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-645611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-645611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-645611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>从俱乐部前往拍卖会现场的时候，我们曾经接触过一块用作传送仪式的太阳石。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_22.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_22\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_22\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-3_5_bg_22.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_22.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-3_5_bg_22.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_22.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-3_5_bg_22.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_22.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-645612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>那个时候，我意识到了一件事情：蝴蝶女士，您对某些颜色极其不敏感，具体来说，您无法区分一些对常人来说差异非常明显的色彩。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_07\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_5_bg_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>我想，这也是像您这样的犯罪天才，无法在第一时间确认真凶的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>您大概耗费了许多时间才发现，一切秘密隐藏在画面的颜色里吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>所以呢，这个小小的发现能发挥什么作用？你该不会以为这样能威胁到我吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>老实说，具体它会发挥什么作用，我并不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>如果我的名字，正巧是您无法辨认的颜色呢？您应该庆幸，野木蓝色并不属于此列。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>于您而言，也许它只是一个微不足道的问题，您可以使用各种各样的方式来掩盖它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>但我相信，像您这样心思细致、想要掌控一切的人，是无法允许任何人得知这样的小缺陷的，无论是您的朋友还是敌人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>你就不担心我杀了你吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>您不会的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对死亡的威胁，他却十分平静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>如您自己先前所言，您在扣下扳机之前，必须完全掌握目标的性格，推演目标的行动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>您想要扮演操纵他人生死命运的神灵，因此，在能够完全掌控我的思维之前，您是不会动手的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>你让我印象深刻，野木蓝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>我会记住<span style=\"font-size:105%\">这</span>、<span style=\"font-size:111%\">份</span>、<span style=\"font-size:116%\">大</span>、<span style=\"font-size:122%\">礼</span>的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她加重了咬字，“友好”地朝对方伸出手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>那我们就好好地保护对方的小秘密了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>作为诚意，如果您有任何关于重塑之手的需求，无论是信息抑或是物品，我都会尽力为您办到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>另外，这份小礼物请您收下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-645613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-645613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-645613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>请节约使用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645621.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-645621.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645621.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645621.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-645621.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645621.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-645621.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645621.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>如今，想要再次制作这种颜料，并非易事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313919.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-313919.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313919.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313919.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-313919.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313919.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-313919.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313919.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>哈，感谢你为科学所做的贡献。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTSC-19"}}